&lt;p&gt;ABOUT POINT72&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Point72 is a leading global alternative investment firm led by Steven A. Cohen with over $58.5 billion in assets under management (as of July 1, 2026). Building on more than 30 years of investing experience, Point72 seeks to deliver superior returns for its investors through fundamental and systematic investing strategies across asset classes and geographies. We aim to attract and retain the industry’s brightest talent by cultivating an investor-led culture and committing to our people’s long-term growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.Point72.com&quot;&gt;www.Point72.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;2027 Software Engineer - Campus Graduate Program - IIT Madras&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A CAREER WITH POINT72&#39;S TECHNOLOGY TEAM&lt;br&gt;As Point72 reimagines the future of investing, our Technology team is constantly improving our company’s IT infrastructure, positioning us at the forefront of a rapidly evolving technology landscape. We’re a team of experts experimenting, discovering new ways to harness the power of open-source solutions, and embracing enterprise agile methodology. We encourage professional development to ensure you bring innovative ideas to our products while satisfying your own intellectual curiosity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;br&gt;We want our office in India to become an incubator for top technology talent of all levels to come build transformative tools and applications—while learning from leading minds in our industry. At Point72 in Bengaluru, you’ll have access to the resources of a global hedge fund while maintaining the creative autonomy needed to help solve complex problems and contribute meaningfully to our success. At Point72, you will work on solving some of the most challenging technology problems in finance like real time data ingestion at scale, advanced analytics pipelines, low-latency trading platforms, AI-driven research tools, and cloud-native applications that need to be secure, resilient, and lightning-fast. With the advent of Agentic AI, there is a marked focus on accelerating our engineering build out leveraging the same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, you will:&lt;br&gt;• Work in small, product-focused teams to design, build, and optimize mission-critical applications that power our portfolio managers, research analysts, and data scientists&lt;br&gt;• Engineer high-performance systems with a focus on scalability and reliability, while having direct access to business and technology stakeholders&lt;br&gt;• Work with live data streams, orchestrating pipelines to process terabytes of structured and unstructured data from global markets, news feeds, geospatial inputs, and alternative sources&lt;br&gt;• Apply AI, machine learning, and advanced statistical techniques to create intelligent tools for idea generation, risk management, predictive analytics and increasing operational efficiency&lt;br&gt;• Contribute to a DevSecOps culture—maintaining high standards of code quality, performance tuning, and security across applications&lt;br&gt;• Experiment with emerging technologies from generative AI to GPU computing to discover new approaches in real-time decision making&lt;br&gt;• Gain exposure to modern tech stacks including Python, Java, C++, React, Agentic AI frameworks, Node.js, Kafka, Spark, Postgres, AWS, Kubernetes, and Terraform&lt;br&gt;• Receive mentorship from seasoned senior technologists and engineers who have experience building sophisticated systems used in the finance industry&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WHAT’S REQUIRED?&lt;br&gt;• Expected bachelor’s or master’s degree in engineering in 2026&lt;br&gt;• Strong programming skills in one or more of the following languages: Python, Java, C++, or similar&lt;br&gt;• Familiarity with software development methodologies and tools (e.g., Git, JIRA)&lt;br&gt;• Ability to manage multiple tasks and deadlines in a fast-paced environment&lt;br&gt;• Strong attention to detail&lt;br&gt;• Strong analytical, writing, verbal communication, and technical skills&lt;br&gt;• Demonstrated ability to work cooperatively with all levels of a team&lt;br&gt;• Ability and willingness to always conduct yourself with professionalism and integrity&lt;br&gt;• Commitment to the highest ethical standard&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WE TAKE CARE OF OUR PEOPLE&lt;br&gt;We invest in our people, their careers, their health, and their well-being. When you work here, we provide:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Health care benefits&lt;br&gt;• Maternity, Adoption &amp;amp; related leave policies&lt;br&gt;• Generous paternity and family care leave policies&lt;br&gt;• Employee Assistance Program &amp;amp; Mental wellness programs&lt;br&gt;• Transportation support&lt;br&gt;• Tuition assistance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ABOUT POINT72&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Point72 is a leading global alternative investment firm led by Steven A. Cohen with over $58.5 billion in assets under management (as of July 1, 2026). Building on more than 30 years of investing experience, Point72 seeks to deliver superior returns for its investors through fundamental and systematic investing strategies across asset classes and geographies. We aim to attract and retain the industry’s brightest talent by cultivating an investor-led culture and committing to our people’s long-term growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.Point72.com&quot;&gt;www.Point72.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;A Career with Point72’s Market Intelligence Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;On our proprietary research team—Market Intelligence—you’ll support Canvas team members as they work with our investment professionals and Compliance team to uncover insights about companies, industries, and the broader economy through deep fundamental research and applying data science and engineering techniques to alternative data sets. You’ll work alongside a talented team with diverse skills, backgrounds, and perspectives. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Canvas is the supply chain research group within Market Intelligence. Canvas conducts compliant supply chain research by developing deep industry expertise, talking with private company executives, and synthesizing information for portfolio managers and analysts. Our team produces impactful research that will change the way you look at the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Fundamental Researcher Internship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When you join the Canvas team, you’re signing up for the learning experience of a lifetime. You will never look at anything the same way—from grocery stores to tires to semiconductors. Every day, Canvas team members speak with some of the most successful private company executives and learn about the businesses they’ve spent their lives building. The team synthesizes findings in comprehensive reports that are consumed by our investment professionals. Other Market Intelligence divisions conduct quantitative research to explain&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;what&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; is going on in an industry. As a Canvas Fundamental Researcher, our qualitative research helps explain &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;why&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; it is happening.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;During the 10-week program based in our New York office, you will gain exposure to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;How Canvas develops subject matter expertise across a range of industries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Gathering insights from small, medium, and large private company executives into their businesses and the industries in which they operate, including real-time changes in supply/demand dynamics, emerging competitors, markets, and technologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Synthesizing research findings in comprehensive daily summaries and reports&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Business leaders across industries, collaborating with Canvas colleagues, and how Canvas research supports more informed investment decision making&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
