&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with senior management to identify opportunities for innovation and growth within the Technology organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement strategic plans that promote innovative solutions and business practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop processes to systematically report on the impact of strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct market and vendor research and analysis to identify trends, opportunities, and competitive insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and oversee projects from conception to execution, ensuring alignment with business goals and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of innovation by encouraging creative thinking and collaboration across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and report on the progress of innovation initiatives, providing insights and recommendations for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships with key stakeholders, both internally and externally, to support innovation efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support zero- based budgeting (ZBB) efforts by analyzing cost drivers, identifying optimization opportunities, and collaborating with functional leaders to develop efficient, needs- based budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
