&lt;li&gt;5 to 10 years of strong hands-on experience with designing, configuring and operating Kubernetes in production, ideally on Amazon EKS, including familiarity with cluster operations, package management, autoscaling, service meshes, and observability tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of other AWS compute and container services, particularly EC2 and ECS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Infrastructure as Code with Terraform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with software development in Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of Linux systems, container runtimes, and networking fundamentals.&lt;/li&gt;
