&lt;p&gt;Please send CVs to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:kepl-talent@cubistsystematic.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;kepl-talent@cubistsystematic.com&lt;/a&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;“2026 KEPL DE Application” &lt;/strong&gt;in the subject line.&lt;/p&gt;
