&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be responsible for supporting Point72’s Treasury function with best-in-class technology solutions. You will align the business needs with technology delivery, provide guidance with strategic business architecture, and execute key business projects in line with business optimization needs. Specifically, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical product buildout to optimize the current application inventory stack while architecting a platform that scales to the firm’s future needs with regards to liquidity, margin and collateral, and key business stakeholder management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop software and analytics to further develop firmwide mandates such as liquidity risk, margin risk management, collateral management, and funding optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and lead key stakeholder relationships, especially between Treasury management and Technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow a group of product specialists, analysts, quantitative strategists, and developers within Technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment of financing, margin, and stock loan business requirements to broader firm technology architecture strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide thought leadership and product input on tooling solutions for margin and collateral optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support business and Treasury on liquidity regulatory enquiries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross function peers to create, administer, track, and close out project deliverables as they pertain to Treasury&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure resources are assigned to projects in line with business analysis and development groups, and monitor commitments in line with the project management team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure teams understand business processes and gaps in capabilities, as well as appropriate data sources, interfaces, and process changes required to address the gaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
