&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate complex technical and risk ideas to non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of data science technologies including machine learning (ML) and ML frameworks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of cloud-ready architectures and technologies such as AWS, GCP, Azure, Microservice Architecture, Streaming, Serialization protocols, NoSQL, and in-memory databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of web architectures and technologies such as Python, Java, GraphQL, APIs, node, React, and Angular.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI tools like Cursor or Claude Code, with the ability to build MCPs, Skills, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of treasury fundamentals across liquidity risk, margin modeling, collateral management, and stress testing, including related optimization models, reporting, and analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of stress event management, planning, and forecasting as it pertains to liquidity, as well as collateral stressing, substitution, and rehypothecation&lt;/li&gt;
