&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional projects and change management efforts to implement organizational change with clarity and speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with HR colleagues and business stakeholders across multiple geographies to ensure consistent execution and local relevance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach managers to strengthen leadership capability, drive accountability, and build high-performing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute day-to-day HR operations for your client groups, including workforce planning, reporting, communication, and escalation management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
