&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in software/AI/ML engineering, with a proven track record of successful delivery of complex, production-grade systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building large-scale enterprise-grade services with high reliability, availability, and observability (SLO/SLA-driven environments).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading other engineers in delivering large-scale solutions iteratively, including setting technical vision, reviewing designs, and growing team capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in programming languages such as Python, Java, or C++.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of distributed systems, cloud platforms (AWS/Azure/GCP), containerization (Docker/Kubernetes), and modern CI/CD practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills and the ability to work independently and collaboratively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, with the ability to convey complex technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders and influence across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
