&lt;li&gt;Strong media relations experience across EMEA and/or APAC, including established relationships with relevant business and financial reporters,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising C-suite executives on complex communications and reputational issues, with sound judgement on sensitive matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong critical thinking skills, with the ability to develop clear recommendations, incorporate different perspectives, and build alignment among stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
